31" end="0:43.079">困于过往不</span><span begin="0:43.079" end="0:43.460">醒</span><span begin="0:43.460" end="0:43.599">的</span><span begin="0:43.599" end="0:43.922">梦</span></p><p begin="0:44.197" end="0:48.437" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.197" end="0:44.915">爱若</span><span begin="0:44.915" end="0:46.054">要被命运捉</span><span begin="0:46.054" end="0:46.597">弄</span> <span begin="0:46.766" end="0:47.536">又何必让</span><span begin="0:47.536" end="0:47.854">心</span><span begin="0:47.854" end="0:48.006">波</span><span begin="0:48.006" end="0:48.437">动</span></p><p begin="0:48.534" end="0:51.970" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.534" end="0:48.870">终</span><span begin="0:48.870" end="0:49.320">究</span><span begin="0:49.320" end="0:49.439">还</span><span begin="0:49.439" end="0:49.898">是落</span><span begin="0:49.898" end="0:50.398">空</span> <span begin="0:50.398" end="0:50.732">下</span><span begin="0:50.732" end="0:50.879">一个</span><span begin="0:50.879" end="0:51.409">又会是</span><span begin="0:51.409" end="0:51.970">谁</span></p><p begin="0:52.349" end="0:53.670" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.349" end="0:53.670">往昔的点点滴滴</span></p><p begin="0:53.850" end="0:56.556" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.850" end="0:55.245">永久与彼此的影子里</span><span begin="0:55.245" end="0:55.718">留下了</span><span begin="0:55.718" end="0:56.556">烙印</span></p><p begin="0:56.695" end="0:58.113" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.695" end="0:57.654">承诺它奄奄一</span><span begin="0:57.654" end="0:58.113">息</span></p><p begin="0:58.223" end="1:00.589" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.223" end="0:58.709">重演着</span><span begin="0:58.709" end="0:59.681">相似的剧情变</span><span begin="0:59.681" end="1:00.589">泡影</span></p><p begin="1:00.612" end="1:04.209" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.612" end="1:01.166">以为海</span><span begin="1:01.166" end="1:01.518">面</span><span begin="1:01.518" end="1:01.646">再</span><span begin="1:01.646" end="1:03.618">暴风雨 还有你</span><span begin="1:03.618" end="1:04.209">理解</span></p><p begin="1:04.359" end="1:08.879" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.359" end="1:04.689">回</span><span begin="1:04.689" end="1:04.791">忆</span><span begin="1:04.791" end="1:05.008">无</span><span begin="1:05.008" end="1:05.328">声</span><span begin="1:05.328" end="1:05.527">肆</span><span begin="1:05.527" end="1:05.859">虐</span> <span begin="1:06.028" end="1:06.986">侵略虚无的</span><span begin="1:06.986" end="1:07.328">每</span><span begin="1:07.328" end="1:07.569">一</span><span begin="1:07.569" end="1:08.879">夜</span></p><p begin="1:09.378" end="1:12.121" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.378" end="1:09.799">一</span><span begin="1:09.799" end="1:09.947">眼</span><span begin="1:09.947" end="1:10.796">万年只</span><span begin="1:10.796" end="1:10.969">是</span><span begin="1:10.969" end="1:11.287">我</span><span begin="1:11.287" end="1:11.469">以</span><span begin="1:11.469" end="1:12.121">为</span></p><p begin="1:13.002" end="1:16.432" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.002" end="1:14.221">自卑蔓延</span><span begin="1:14.221" end="1:14.379">着</span><span begin="1:14.379" end="1:14.750">早</span><span begin="1:14.750" end="1:15.411">将我击</span><span begin="1:15.411" end="1:16.432">退</span></p><p begin="1:16.856" end="1:19.213" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.856" end="1:17.606">所以不再</span><span begin="1:17.606" end="1:17.736">问</span><span begin="1:17.736" end="1:18.265">原因</span> <span begin="1:18.265" end="1:19.213">不奢求怜悯</span></p><p begin="1:19.213" end="1:20.575" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.213" end="1:20.127">凝视你眼</span><span begin="1:20.127" end="1:20.575">睛</span></p><p begin="1:20.716" end="1:23.787" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.716" end="1:21.536">善意的谎</span><span begin="1:21.536" end="1:21.873">言</span><span begin="1:21.873" end="1:22.886">也终将</span><span begin="1:22.886" end="1:23.787">尽</span></p><p begin="1:25.560" end="1:29.543" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.560" end="1:25.959">但</span><span begin="1:25.959" end="1:26.188">你</span><span begin="1:26.188" end="1:26.688">是一</span><span begin="1:26.688" end="1:26.992">个</span><span begin="1:26.992" end="1:28.113">heartbreaker</span> <span begin="1:28.389" end="1:29.543">sundowner</span></p><p begin="1:29.648" end="1:33.396" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.648" end="1:30.943">多希望是你</span> <span begin="1:30.943" end="1:31.205">周</span><span begin="1:31.205" end="1:31.683">旋</span><span begin="1:31.683" end="1:31.986">着</span> <span begin="1:32.243" end="1:33.115">妥协</span><span begin="1:33.115" end="1:33.396">着</span></p><p begin="1:33.605" end="1:37.864" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.605" end="1:34.532">但最后却</span><span begin="1:34.532" end="1:34.844">是</span><span begin="1:34.844" end="1:35.703">言语</span><span begin="1:35.703" end="1:36.295">刺骨</span> <span begin="1:36.455" end="1:37.024">手</span><span begin="1:37.024" end="1:37.864">冰冷</span></p><p begin="1:37.864" end="1:40.884" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.864" end="1:38.214">我</span><span begin="1:38.214" end="1:38.662">无法</span><span begin="1:38.662" end="1:39.993">感谢你嘴里</span><span begin="1:39.993" end="1:40.134">的</span><span begin="1:40.134" end="1:40.452">同</span><span begin="1:40.452" end="1:40.884">情</span></p><p begin="1:41.190" end="1:45.290" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.190" end="1:41.879">多希</span><span begin="1:41.879" end="1:42.570">望你是</span><span begin="1:42.570" end="1:43.127">gold</span> <span begin="1:43.127" end="1:43.358">dig</span><span begin="1:43.358" end="1:43.796">ger</span> <span begin="1:43.906" end="1:45.290">mindseeker</span></p><p begin="1:45.290" end="1:48.999" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.290" end="1:46.427">是你对我在</span><span begin="1:46.427" end="1:47.639">索取着</span> <span begin="1:47.908" end="1:48.408">罗</span><span begin="1:48.408" end="1:48.999">列着</span></p><p begin="1:49.177" end="1:53.576" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.177" end="1:49.794">但现</span><span begin="1:49.794" end="1:50.446">实却是</span> <span begin="1:50.446" end="1:50.924">我</span><span begin="1:50.924" end="1:52.546">无法让你</span><span begin="1:52.546" end="1:53.576">兴奋</span></p><p begin="1:53.789" end="1:56.719" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.789" end="1:56.229">你连被追求都难以配</span><span begin="1:56.229" end="1:56.719">合</span></p><p begin="1:57.085" end="2:00.855" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.085" end="1:57.403">是</span><span begin="1:57.403" end="1:57.922">谁</span><span begin="1:57.922" end="1:58.153">的</span><span begin="1:58.153" end="2:00.855">错</span></p></div></body></tt>